  "aiContextParagraph": "The Brazilian media community is mourning the loss of two prominent figures following separate announcements on November 20, 2026. Social media personality Gabriel Félix, who was 29, died on the evening of November 19, with his passing confirmed by his partner, Isabelle Abreu. Additionally, the sporting community reported the death of bodybuilder Itemberg Nunes at age 31. Nunes, a native of Maranhão who previously competed in the Men's Physique division, had his passing announced by his sponsor, Overcoming Suplementos. Sources close to the athlete stated that he had been undergoing treatment for cancer. These recent deaths follow a series of losses involving notable figures in Brazilian culture and professional spheres throughout the month of November, including the death of pioneering television director Nilton Travesso at age 92 earlier in the month.",
